    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, lemon juice, ginger garlic paste and apply generously all over the chicken.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for 15-20 minutes.",
      "In a bowl, add mustard oil, hung curd, degi red chili powder, roasted gram flour, crushed black peppercorns, ginger garlic paste, salt to taste, mustard oil and mix it well.",
      "Add marinated chicken and marinate it well.",
      "In a handi, add ghee, once it's hot, add bay leaf, cinnamon stick, onions and saute it for a while until golden brown.",
      "Add tomatoes, oil, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, salt to taste and saute it for 5-6 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add water, curd and cook it well for a while.",
      "Add green cardamom, water, cashew nuts, let it cook for 10-12 minutes until mushy and cooked well.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a grill pan, add ghee, once it's hot, place marinated chicken and grill it for 5-6 minutes on each side until half cooked.",
      "Transfer it to a tray and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In the same handi, add prepared gravy, water to adjust the consistency, salt to taste, honey, butter and give it a quick boil.",
      "Add salt to taste, cooked chicken, fresh cream, butter and cook it for 7-8 minutes on medium flames until cooked well.",
      "Finish it with fenugreek leaves and mix it well.",
      "Place a small steel bowl in the middle, add burnt coal, butter, cover it with a lid and give it smoke for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl, garnish it with fresh cream, dry fenugreek leaves and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot."
    ],
